B.h6D=new A.e3("Added: Bulk actions to change the category of expenses, assign clients to a group, set the tax category of products, cancel invoices, convert quotes to projects, mark credits paid and email payment receipts",B.aX)
B.h7B=new A.e3("Updated: Device Settings are redesigned, Payment Settings opens with your gateways and payment types, and a group opens on an overview of the settings it overrides",B.aX)
B.h7s=new A.e3("Updated: Contacts show the email and phone under each name, the client's local time and a quick way to add a contact",B.aX)
B.h71=new A.e3("Added: Creating a product from a line item can set its cost",B.aX)
B.h6g=new A.e3("Fixed: Many smaller issues, including payment link steps showing blank, a gap in field borders, the record pane squeezing the list, and settings that a free plan cannot save now saying so",B.aX)
